 "insight": [
  "Monthly exports of iron and steel started at 146.0 million euros in January 2022 and decreased to 112.0 million euros by June 2026.",
  "This represents a decline of 23.3% over the period from January 2022 to June 2026.",
  "The highest monthly export value was in May 2022, reaching 202.6 million euros.",
  "Exports have generally trended downward since the peak in May 2022.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of the trend."
